.claude/worktrees/

# Substack cross-post pipeline: scripts + publish records ARE tracked
# (the whole dir was ignored here before, which is how the tooling got
# lost twice). Only runtime debris stays ignored.
substack-port-work/shots/
substack-port-work/*.log
substack-all.md

# --- Credential hardening (added 2026-07-12, SECR-2) ---
# Never commit secrets. .env.example stays tracked (placeholder values only).
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*secret*.json
*secret*.txt
*_token.json
*token*.json
*.pem
*.p12
*.key
*service-account*.json
*credentials*.json
*seed phrase*
*recovery_codes*
*two_factor*
